  <text x="400" y="40" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">TP 01 — Topologie Étoile</text>
  <text x="400" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#94a3b8">Schéma pédagogique — Module Réseaux — Dr. BELACEL Madani</text>
  <rect x="50" y="95" width="700" height="40" rx="6" fill="#1e293b"/>
  <text x="400" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#fff" font-weight="bold">TP 01 — Montage d'une Topologie Étoile</text>
  <circle cx="400" cy="180" r="35" fill="#1e293b"/>
  <text x="400" y="184" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#fff" font-weight="bold">Switch</text>
  <rect x="160" y="260" width="80" height="40" rx="6" fill="#3b82f6"/><text x="200" y="285" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#fff">PC1</text>
  <rect x="360" y="260" width="80" height="40" rx="6" fill="#22c55e"/><text x="400" y="285" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#fff">PC2</text>
  <rect x="560" y="260" width="80" height="40" rx="6" fill="#f59e0b"/><text x="600" y="285" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#fff">PC3</text>
  <text x="400" y="340" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">Matériel: 3 PC + 1 Switch + Câbles RJ45 droits</text>
  <text x="400" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">Configuration: 192.168.1.10/24, 192.168.1.20/24, 192.168.1.30/24</text>
  <text x="400" y="376" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">Test: ping entre PC — observer les trames avec Wireshark</text>
